abstract: >-
  Paper, GAP scripts, log certificates, coverage cross-checks, and
  arithmetic receipts supporting a negative solution to Kourovka
  Notebook Problem 10.34: every finite group that is the product of
  every pair of its non-conjugate maximal subgroups is soluble.
